# Port for local dev (optional, defaults to 5002)
# PORT=5002

# Shared secret used to authorize callers (the mbuffs backend).
# Generate one with: openssl rand -base64 32
# The backend must set the matching SCRAPER_API_KEY value.
SCRAPER_API_KEY="YOUR_SCRAPER_SHARED_SECRET_AT_LEAST_32_CHARS"

# --- Local development only ---
# The headless-browser fallback uses @sparticuz/chromium's bundled binary on Vercel,
# which doesn't run on macOS. For local dev, point this at an installed Chrome:
# CHROME_EXECUTABLE_PATH="/Applications/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome"